# === SECRETS — never commit (R15) ===
*token*.json
# Allow harmless test fixtures whose names contain "token" (e.g. drive
# getStartPageToken responses). The broad *token*.json rule above is intended
# for real OAuth artifacts; golden fixtures under tests are safe to track.
!**/fixtures/golden/**/*token*.json
